    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">50 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine coding case study</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Rank 14 of 18</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Digital Wallet &amp; Payment Gateway</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Design a Paytm/PhonePe-style wallet: top up through UPI or card, send money, see a statement, reverse a transfer. Money must never be created, lost or moved twice, even when the network retries and many threads run at once. Double-entry ledger, idempotency keys, Strategy + Adapter for gateways, with runnable Java, Python and C++.</p>\n  <div class=\"chips\">\n    <span class=\"chip company\">PhonePe</span><span class=\"chip company\">Paytm</span><span class=\"chip company\">Groww</span><span class=\"chip company\">Flipkart</span><span class=\"chip company\">Walmart</span><span class=\"chip company\">CRED</span><span class=\"chip company\">Razorpay</span>\n  </div>\n"
